Step 1: Turn off Windows protection, then open the vortex.overlay folder.

Step 2: First, open the RUN-1 folder. Right-click the RunMe application, select "Run as administrator," and wait for 5 seconds.

Step 3: Second, open the RUN-2 folder, double-click the quicksearch application, and wait for the overlay to appear.

Step 4: After all these steps, open the .seb file. The overlay is bypassed automatically and can be used inside the SEB.

Step 5: If you need to change any settings, please do so before launching the SEB.

Important note:

If the overlay crashes inside the SEB or stops working, don't worry — press Ctrl+Shift on the left side of the keyboard, and the Edge browser will open inside the SEB.

                                     Use it at your own risk. All the best!
